'''Rusty''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Gold Mine}}. He sells back one-time rewards from quests for a certain amount of {{c}}.

For some upgradable items, '''Rusty''' sells all levels of the item. While for some upgradable items, he only sells the highest unlocked form of the item, as indicated in the list below. 

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}

== Shop ==
{{/List}}

== Dialogue ==
{| class="wikitable"
! colspan="2" | Condition
!Dialogue
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" | First Interaction<br>'''SkyBlock Level 6+'''
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Rusty&f: Hi, I'm the janitor of this mine.
&e[NPC] Rusty&f: You would not believe how many people leave ingots and stones behind them!
&e[NPC] Rusty&f: It drives me insane, but at least you unlocked &aAuto-pickup&f.
&e[NPC] Rusty&f: It makes my job a lot easier, but despite that, I still find so many items on the ground.
&e[NPC] Rusty&f: Maybe some of those items are yours? In which case I'll let you buy them back.
}}
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" | First Interaction<br>Below '''SkyBlock Level 6'''
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Rusty&f: Hi, I'm the janitor of this mine.
&e[NPC] Rusty&f: You would not believe how many people leave ingots and stones behind them!
&e[NPC] Rusty&f: It drives me insane, but at least you'll unlock &aAuto-pickup &fat &3SkyBlock Level 6&f.
&e[NPC] Rusty&f: It makes my job a lot easier, but despite that, I still find so many items on the ground.
&e[NPC] Rusty&f: Maybe some of these items are yours? In which case I'll let you buy them back.
}}
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" | After Finding [[Lazy Miner]]'s Pickaxe
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Rusty&f: You found the Lazy Miner's pickaxe!
&e[NPC] Rusty&f: I'll have to put it in my stores.
&e[NPC] Rusty&f: Click me again!
}}
|-
| class="ct" | [[Abiphones#Contacts|{{Aqua|Abiphone Contact}}]]
| class="ct" | None
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Rusty&f:&b ✆&f Did I find an Abiphone?
&e[NPC] Rusty&f:&b ✆&f Yes, sometimes I do find one lying around.
&e[NPC] Rusty&f:&b ✆&f What?
&e[NPC] Rusty&f:&b ✆&f You...
&e[NPC] Rusty&f:&b ✆&f You want my contact?
&e[NPC] Rusty&f:&b ✆&f Me?
&e[NPC] Rusty&f:&b ✆&f The janitor?
&e[NPC] Rusty&f:&b ✆&f I...
&e[NPC] Rusty&f:&b ✆&f I don't... don't know what to say...
&e[NPC] Rusty&f:&b ✆&f Yes of course you can have it!
}}
|-
| rowspan="3" class="ct" | {{zone|The Garden}}
| class="ct" | None
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &9Rusty&f: Ever wondered how I find all the things that other players lost? I outsource it. Right now, someone is looking for their &7[crop]&f. Can you find that for me?}}
|-
| class="ct" | Completing
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &9Rusty&f: There we go, a job well done. I'll make sure to leave a good review for you!}}
|-
| class="ct" | Denying
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &9Rusty&f: Turns out, if you want something done, you have to do it yourself.}}
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" | First Interaction<br>{{DG|Before April 25, 2022}}
|{{Dialogue|
&e[NPC] Rusty&f: Hi, I'm the janitor of this mine.
&e[NPC] Rusty&f: You would not believe how many people leave ingots and stones behind them!
&e[NPC] Rusty&f: It drives me insane, everyone should be using &dTelekinesis &fon their tools!
&e[NPC] Rusty&f: If you want I can apply Telekinesis on any of your items for &6100 coins&f.
}}
|}

==Trivia== 
*'''Rusty''' used to have no shop and only applied {{Blue|'''Telekinesis'''}} on tools for {{C|100}}. This was changed alongside the introduction of [[Auto-pickup]].
*The {{Item|White Belt}} (and its upgrades), [[Kuudra Follower Armor]], {{Item|Campfire Initiate Badge}} (and its upgrades), {{Item|Soul Campfire Initiate Badge}} (and its upgrades), {{Item|Book of Progression}}, {{Item|Shiny Yellow Rock}} (and its upgrades), {{Item|Kuudra Follower Artifact}} (and its upgrade, {{Item|Kuudra Follower Relic}}), {{Item|Kuudra Teeth Plaque}} and {{Item|Safari Belt}} are not affected by the discount from {{Item|Shady Ring}}, {{Item|Crooked Artifact}}, or {{Item|Seal of the Family}}. It is unknown if this is intentional or a bug.
*Buying {{Item|Safari Belt}} will give the player the item with the exact same upgrades as their last modified one. {{InfoNeeded}}

== History ==
{{History table
|ahn=
{{History|2022/October 13|[[File:Rusty.png|26px]] '''Rusty''' can now sell the {{Item|Void Sword}} and {{Item|Dragon Shortbow}}.}}
|beta=
{{History|2019/August 2|[[File:Rusty.png|26px]] Added '''Rusty'''.}}
{{History|2021/November 8|'''Rusty''' will now only accept unstacked items.}}
{{History|2022/April 25|'''Rusty''' will now instead sell items that can only be normally obtained once.}}
{{History|2022/May 11|'''Rusty''' can now sell the {{Item|Grandma Wolf Pet}} and {{Item|Travel Scroll to the Crystal Nucleus}}.}}
{{History|2022/July 19|link=none|'''Rusty''' can now sell the {{Item|The Alchemist's Staff}}, one of the [[belts]] from [[Dojo]], and {{Item|The Cake}}.}}
{{History|2022/Aug 27|'''Rusty''' can now sell the {{Item|Iron Pickaxe}} from the {{NPCSprite|Lazy Miner}}'s quest.}}
{{History|0.16|Added [[Abiphones#Contacts|{{Aqua|Abiphone Contact}}]].|'''Rusty''' can now sell the {{Item|Void Sword}} and {{Item|Dragon Shortbow}}.}}
{{History|0.16.1|'''Rusty''' can now sell the {{Item|Archaeologist's Compass}}.}}
{{History|0.18.1|'''Rusty''' can now sell {{Item|Jake's Plushie}}.}}
{{History|0.18.4|'''Rusty''' can now sell {{Item|Dwarven Tankard}}.}}
{{History|0.20.4|Fixed Fallen Star Helmet not showing up in '''Rusty's''' Shop after meeting the requirements.}}
}}

