'''Vargul the Unearthed''', sometimes just '''Vargul''', is an [[NPC]] found in {{Zone|Ruins}} during the [[Great Spook]]. The player can spend {{Item|Dark Candy}} at their shop to obtain exclusive items.

== Interface ==
{{/UI}}
This menu can also be accessed with the {{Code|/openvargulmenu}} command

== Dialogue ==
{| class="wikitable"
! colspan="2" |Condition
!Dialogue
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" | First Interaction
|{{Dialogue|
&c&oThe ground beneath you trembles, and an eerie wind howls through the air...
&f&l[&c&lVargul&f&l]&7: &dWho dares disturb my eternal slumber?
&c&oThe tombstone cracks and shifts!
&f&l[&c&lVargul&f&l]&7: &dYou better have something to offer me.
&f&lVargul the Unearthed has awakened!
}}
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" rowspan="7" | Future Unearth Interactions
|{{Dialogue|
&c&oThe ground beneath you trembles, and an eerie wind howls through the air...
&f&l[&c&lVargul&f&l]&7: &dWho dares disturb my eternal slumber?
&c&oThe tombstone cracks and shifts!
&f&l[&c&lVargul&f&l]&7: &dYou better have something to offer me.
&f&lVargul the Unearthed has awakened!
}}
|-
|{{Dialogue|
&c&oThe earth shakes with knowing fury.
&f&l[&c&lVargul&f&l]&7: &dYou've become a regular visitor.
&c&oThe tombstone practically opens itself.
&f&l[&c&lVargul&f&l]&7: &dAh, my most loyal servant returns.
&f&lVargul the Unearthed has awakened!
}}
|-
|{{Dialogue|
&c&oThe earth shivers in anticipation...
&f&l[&c&lVargul&f&l]&7: &dOnce more you wake me.
&c&oThe tombstone shifts, almost eager.
&f&l[&c&lVargul&f&l]&7: &dI sense you have more offerings.
&f&lVargul the Unearthed has awakened!
}}
|-
|{{Dialogue|
&c&oA familiar rumble echoes.
&l[&cVargul&f]&r&7: &dSo, you seek my favor again?
&c&oThe tombstone rises quicker this time.
&l[&cVargul&f]&r&7: &dYou're proving to be quite useful.
&f&lVargul the Unearthed has awakened!
}}
|-
|{{Dialogue|
&c&oThe ground almost hums with energy...
&l[&cVargul&f]&r&7: &dI grow accustomed to these interruptions.
&c&oThe tombstone practivally leaps from the ground.
&l[&cVargul&f]&r&7: &dYou've earned a place in my dark realm.
&f&lVargul the Unearthed has awakened!
}}
|-
|{{Dialogue|
&o&cThe ground rumbles, almost lazily.
&l&f[&l&cVargul&l&f]&r&7: &dAh, you again...
&o&cThe tombstone creaks open with little fanfare.
&l&f[&l&cVargul&l&f]&r&7: &dReturn as often as you wish, but know that my generosity has its limits.
&f&lVargul the Unearthed has awakened!
}}
|-
|{{Dialogue|
&o&cThe ground quakes once more...
&l&f[&l&cVargul&l&f]&r&7: &dYou dare return?!
&o&cThe tombstone seems to mend itself.
&l&f[&l&cVargul&l&f]&r&7: &dAh, it's you again. Have you brought more Dark Candies?
&f&lVargul the Unearthed has awakened!
}}
|-
| colspan="2" class="ct" |Donating {{Item|Dark Candy|amount=10|text=Dark Candies}} after completing all milestones<br>{{DG|Great Spook 2023}}
|{{Dialogue|
&o&cThe ground rumbles, almost lazily.
&l&f[&l&cVargul&l&f]&r&7: &dAh, you again...
&o&cThe tombstone creaks open with little fanfare.
&l&f[&l&cVargul&l&f]&r&7: &dReturn as often as you wish, but know that my generosity has its limits.
}}
|-
| class="ct" rowspan="3" |{{zone|The Garden}}
| class="ct" | None
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &6Vargul&f: Sometimes, &9Dark Candy &fis not enough to satiate a gnawing hunger. Something...more, is needed.}}
|-
| class="ct" | Completing
|{{Dialogue|&e[NPC] &6Vargul&f: Your offering is appreciated.}}
|-
| class="ct" | Denying
|{{InfoNeeded}}
|}

== Trivia ==
*'''Vargul''', {{NPCSprite|Alchemist}} and {{NPCSprite|Sherry}} are the only [[Garden Visitors]] to have neither the sprite of a player nor a Villager.

==Bugs==
* '''Vargul''' cannot be offered a {{item|Bachelor's Rose}}.

