'''Jeff''' is an [[NPC]] in {{Zone|The Garden}} that teaches the player about [[Garden Chips]].

They appear in the player's barn when they reach {{Skl|Garden}} level 4. The player must show them a [[Specialized Farming Tool]] to unlock [[Garden Chips]] and to be able to spend {{Sowdust}}.

After completing the introduction quest, interacting with '''Jeff''' or using the {{Code|/chips}} command opens the [[Garden Chips]] interface.

